    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>If you plant an ordinary shrub in this 10-pound clay pot and let it grow for 30 days, the shrub magically transforms into an <strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd-dungeon-masters-guide.actors.Actor.gaSTr7DFZJLmgI2J]{Awakened Shrub}</strong> at the end of that time. When the shrub awakens, its roots break the pot, destroying it.</p><p>The awakened shrub is Friendly toward you and obeys your commands. Absent commands from you, it does nothing.</p>",
